# The schema bootstrap SQL that docker/test/run_tests.sh needs ON THE SERVER.
# The blanket *.sql rule above excluded it and `git add` said nothing, so the
# runner failed at "restore_four_fks.sql: No such file or directory" after a
# successful replay. These two files are tooling, not a database dump.
!docker/test/schema_fix/*.sql

# Same reason, same trap: the synthetic fixture the runner loads into the
# disposable PostgreSQL. It is a versioned DEFINITION written by hand - every
# value is literal in the file - not a dump of anybody's data.
!docker/test/fixtures/*.sql
